# Chint DSSU666.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Chint DSSU666 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: chint-dtsu666-manual.pdf
# | - 3-phase 3-wire DIN-rail energy meter (delta connection, no neutral).
# | - Same register map as DTSU666 except B-phase power/reactive/PF registers
# | (addresses 8214, 8222, 8238) are not valid in delta configuration.
# | - Holding registers, FC03. Big-endian word order (MSW first).
# | - f32 values carry embedded scale: V×0.1, A×0.001, W/var×0.1, PF×0.001, Hz×0.01.
# | - Energy registers contain direct kWh values (no scale).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8E1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Chint
@model=DSSU666
@vendor_website=chintglobal.com
@description=3-phase 3-wire DIN-rail energy meter (delta) — Uab/Ubc/Uca, Ua/Uc, Ia/Ic, active/reactive power for phases A+C and total, PF, frequency, import/export energy.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/chint-dssu666.toml; Source: chint-dtsu666-manual.pdf. Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
